And he was a planter, a bigwig in the local area. He owned the big store in Yorkville, which was the kind of county seat. And he's one of many bigwigs involved with the clan. So another one is one of the county's richest landowners, a man called William C. Black. And it was William C. Black who ordered the first notable murder. And this was the murder of a man called Tom Roundtree. Tom Roundtree was a spokesman for the African American, the freedmen of the county. And he was a married man with children. And in December 1870, a mob of Klansman came to his house, they dragged him out, they shot him, and they cut his throat. His widow was able to identify some of the killers. But this landowner, William C. Black, paid. for the defence of the killers. He organised it. He sorted out alibis for them. And in the end, Mrs. Roundtree and her children were driven from their home and had to flee the county. And that set
他是一个种植园主，是当地的大人物。他拥有约克维尔（Yorkville）的大商店，那是该县的县治。他是参与三K党的众多大人物之一。另一个是该县最富有的土地所有者之一，一个叫威廉·C·布莱克（William C. Black）的人。正是威廉·C·布莱克下令进行了第一次著名的谋杀。这就是汤姆·朗特里（Tom Roundtree）的谋杀案。汤姆·朗特里是该县非裔美国人、获得自由的奴隶的代言人。他是一个有妻子和孩子的已婚男人。1870年12月，一群三K党暴徒来到他家，把他拖出来，开枪打死，并割断了他的喉咙。他的遗孀能够认出一些凶手。但这个土地所有者威廉·C·布莱克为凶手的辩护支付了费用。他组织了这一切。他为他们安排了不在场证明。最终，朗特里夫人和她的孩子们被赶出了家园，不得不逃离该县。这奠定了

