94
00:48:21.000 --> 00:49:01.000
disabled. It's not clear whether it was polio or muscular dystrophy or something along those lines. So he can't walk, he can't crawl, he needs help to clothe and to feed himself. He is a very impressive person. He had learned to read and write. He'd been taught by local white children that he kind of played with. After the civil war, he became an ordained preacher. He was the president of the local union league and he opened a school for black children. And all of this, of course, brought him to the attention of the clan. And the fact that he was so severely disabled did not protect him. Because at midnight on the 5th of May, a group of clansmen burst into his cabin.
残疾。不清楚是小儿麻痹症还是肌肉萎缩症之类的。所以他不能走路，不能爬行，需要帮助才能穿衣和进食。他是一个非常令人印象深刻的人。他学会了读写。他是和当地白人孩子一起玩时被教的。内战后，他成为了一名受戒的传教士。他是当地工会联盟的主席，并为黑人儿童开办了一所学校。所有这些当然引起了三K党的注意。他身体残疾的事实并没有保护他。因为在5月5日午夜，一群三K党成员闯入了他的木屋。

