00:49:01.000 --> 00:49:25.000
They dragged him out into the yard. They beat him. They lashed him with a horse whip. They said that he was stirring up a race war. They accused him absurdly of plotting a campaign of rape against white women. And they beat him all night. They didn't kill him. But the story became a gigantic scandal because, of course, the fact that he was so badly disabled
他们把他拖到院子里。他们殴打他。他们用马鞭抽打他。他们说他在煽动种族战争。他们荒谬地指控他策划针对白人妇女的强奸运动。他们整晚都在殴打他。他们没有杀他。但这个故事变成了一个巨大的丑闻，因为当然，他身体残疾得如此严重

96
00:49:25.000 --> 00:49:46.000
